column4:
Yes, I've heard the tale; 
you are heading to the new Ark 
that fell into the western sea, correct?

I'm going to Mergoda.
This isn't where I belong;
my place is over there!

Acho que era como se ela quisesse uma folga,
ou talvez apenas um tempo sozinha;
algo nessa linha.

No entanto, essa é a maneira da natureza.
Naquela época, Lorde Dragão Branco não era nada de especial;
mas algo semelhante ao vento e às nuvens.

Não, Mayleaf está segura;
ela deve estar ao lado de
Lorde Dragão Branco.

Não, Mayleaf está segura;
ela deve estar ao lado de
Lorde Dragão Branco.

If you can obtain the strength to guard Cecily 
from the Black Knight's malevolent hands, 
I will say no more about Leo.

Do not worry about us; 
We will offer assistance 
to the people of Phindym.

Of course, it is not fear that drives us;
battling Dragons is beyond imagination.
For us, the closest emotion is that of taboo.

We can go out somewhere to 
fight or search for things; 
that's something we can do.

We battle the dragon that stole peace
from this land. I am Quintus,
a caretaker of the Liberation Army.

For me, the peace in Lestania is the top priority;
I want to know as soon as possible
what may happen next.

Please let me start everything
from here with you, 
and please help guide this inexperienced Arisen.

To summarize the current situation;
while using Rothgill Village as a base 
for diversionary tactics――

With Quintus behind me, unless demons are falling 
from above--no, no, 
let's not start imagining bad things.

In any case, 
if you invade the Royal Capital Megado, 
you will inevitably be confronted with them.

Thou must not allow harm to befall Phindym;
now is the hour to repay the favor bestowed 
by the Spirit Dragon.

Whilst life doth remain, 
the strife shall endure; 
therefore――

Thou must not make this thy final battle; 
hasten――
to the abyss of Mergoda.

It seems that among the support requests gathered 
from <NAME AREA>, 
there were some that had a high level of urgency.

Get to the optimum distance away
from enemies while using Magick Eye: Seeker,
and attack them for more than 3 seconds.

There is not enough Golden Gemstones. To draw
from the lot once,
<VAL> Golden Gemstones are required.

There is not enough Golden Gemstones. To draw
from the lot <VAL> times,
<VAL> Golden Gemstones are required.

À direita, fica a Fonte da Cura; 
à esquerda, a Fonte da Vitalidade; e, no centro, 
a Fonte da Abundância.
